<view class="{{['data-v-85898ece', 'container', i]}}"><view class="page-shell gold-shell data-v-85898ece"><view class="page-header gold-header data-v-85898ece"><text class="title data-v-85898ece">🥇 黄金行情</text><text class="subtitle data-v-85898ece">查询黄金、足金、金条等行情参考价</text></view><view class="toolbar-card card data-v-85898ece"><view class="data-v-85898ece"><text class="toolbar-label data-v-85898ece">行情列表</text><text class="toolbar-desc data-v-85898ece">数据仅供参考，交易以实际报价为准</text></view><button class="refresh-btn data-v-85898ece" bindtap="{{b}}" disabled="{{c}}">{{a}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{d}}" class="loading data-v-85898ece"><text class="loading-icon data-v-85898ece">⏳</text><text class="loading-text data-v-85898ece">正在加载黄金行情...</text></view><view wx:elif="{{e}}" class="error-box card data-v-85898ece"><text class="error-text data-v-85898ece">{{f}}</text><button class="retry-btn data-v-85898ece" bindtap="{{g}}">重新加载</button></view><view wx:else class="gold-list data-v-85898ece"><view wx:for="{{h}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="h" class="gold-card card data-v-85898ece"><view class="gold-name-row data-v-85898ece"><text class="gold-name data-v-85898ece">{{item.a}}</text><text class="gold-tag data-v-85898ece">{{item.b}}</text></view><text class="gold-price data-v-85898ece">{{item.c}}</text><view class="gold-meta data-v-85898ece"><text wx:if="{{item.d}}" class="data-v-85898ece">涨跌：{{item.e}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.f}}" class="data-v-85898ece">{{item.g}}</text></view></view></view><view class="note-card card data-v-85898ece"><text class="note-title data-v-85898ece">风险提示</text><text class="note-text data-v-85898ece">黄金价格会随国际市场、汇率、品牌工费波动，本页面只做查询参考，不构成投资建议。</text></view></view></view>